ches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nAdds support for a new GDScript lifecycle method: `after_ready()` \r\nThis method is automatically called **after `_ready()`** has run on all nodes in the scene tree, allowing logic to run when everything is fully initialized.\r\n\r\nThis addresses the proposal discussed here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10889\r\n\r\n### Example\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    print(\"ready\")\r\n\r\nfunc after_ready():\r\n    print(\"after ready\")\r\n ```\r\n \r\nOutput \r\n\r\n```\r\nready\r\nafter ready\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs seen above, `after_ready()` is called **after** the `_ready()` method finishes\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-08T16:05:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T13:37:48Z","closed_at":"2025-07-09T16:30:58Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1a910a9c62c7ef6ee13bb7b408c0c91567598054","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"keyzeuh:after_ready","ref":"after_ready","repo":{"id":10